# Apache HTTP Server configuration: Apache HTTP Server 2.4 documentation: configuration files and directive index; requirements/languages/apache.md
name     apache apacheconf htaccess
keyword  ServerRoot ServerName ServerAdmin Listen DocumentRoot DirectoryIndex ErrorLog CustomLog LogLevel
keyword  LoadModule Include IncludeOptional Options AllowOverride Require Order Allow Deny Redirect
keyword  RewriteEngine RewriteRule RewriteCond Alias ScriptAlias ProxyPass ProxyPassReverse Header
keyword  SetEnv SSLEngine SSLCertificateFile SSLCertificateKeyFile AddType AddHandler
builtin  On Off all granted denied None Indexes FollowSymLinks
fold-case
line-comment   #
string   " "  : escapes
operators  <>/
hook     variables
